concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-7aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7AA Appointments between 1 July 1990 and 30 June 1992"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-7aa ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies to an appointment made under section 7 on or after 1 July 1990 at a time when this Act has not become an enactment within the meaning of the Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988.  (2) Such an appointment shall not be made unless, before tendering advice to the Governor-General, the Attorney-General has consulted with the Australian Capital Territory Executive.  (3) This section ceases to have effect on 1 July 1992." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies to an appointment made under section 7 on or after 1 July 1990 at a time when this Act has not become an enactment within the meaning of the Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988.  (2) Such an appointment shall not be made unless, before tendering advice to the Governor-General, the Attorney-General has consulted with the Australian Capital Territory Executive.  (3) This section ceases to have effect on 1 July 1992."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0678ea57f29bbdb0230b4a5e751d85878f1da78e712a4899cb5a2fb95aaa0f38" ;
