concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-8-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(2) Exercise of jurisdiction"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-8-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person who is dissatisfied with a judgment of the Master made in the exercise of jurisdiction conferred by Rules of Court may appeal, as prescribed by the Rules of Court:" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person who is dissatisfied with a judgment of the Master made in the exercise of jurisdiction conferred by Rules of Court may appeal, as prescribed by the Rules of Court:"@en ;
