concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-33d-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33D(6) Removal from office"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33d-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Master becomes bankrupt, applies to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors, compounds with his or her creditors or makes an assignment of his or her remuneration for their benefit, the Governor-General shall remove the Master from office." ;
