concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-33f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33F(4) Acting appointments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person acting as Master has all the powers and duties of the Master, and the laws of the Commonwealth and the Territory (including this Act and the Rules of Court) apply in relation to the person as if the person were the Master." ;
