concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-33f-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33F(7) Acting appointments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33f-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Anything done by or in relation to a person purporting to act as Master is not invalid because:  (a) the occasion for the appointment had not arisen;   The Master  Part III  Section 33F  Australian Capital Territory Supreme Court Act 1933  (b) there was a defect or irregularity in connection with the appointment; or  (c) the appointment had ceased to have effect." ;
    skos:definition "(7) Anything done by or in relation to a person purporting to act as Master is not invalid because:  (a) the occasion for the appointment had not arisen;   The Master  Part III  Section 33F  Australian Capital Territory Supreme Court Act 1933  (b) there was a defect or irregularity in connection with the appointment; or  (c) the appointment had ceased to have effect."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8afc58766af64f3373a640706f904eea80bb5198a3e8a637e8ff412363bb0b47" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-33f ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Anything done by or in relation to a person purporting to act as Master is not invalid." ;
