concept:australian-capital-territory-supreme-court-act-1933-sec-47 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47 Seal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-47 ;
    values:originalText "The Supreme Court shall have and use as occasion requires a Seal, having inscribed thereon the words ‘The Seal of the Supreme Court of the Australian Capital Territory’. The Seal shall be kept in such custody as the Chief Justice directs." ;
    skos:definition "The Supreme Court shall have and use as occasion requires a Seal, having inscribed thereon the words ‘The Seal of the Supreme Court of the Australian Capital Territory’. The Seal shall be kept in such custody as the Chief Justice directs."@en ;
